this is an example of an iboxreplica that will create a PVC for the remote replica using fc protocol and ASYNC replication.

To test this you would:

 * make setup
 * verify that the iboxreplica, pvc, pv was created on the kube cluster
 * manually remove the iboxreplica, that should remove the replication
 * make setup-pod
 * verify that the pod starts and mounts the remote pvc that was created


In this example, a storage class is created for the remote PVC that is going 
to be created by the iboxreplica.
